 (text "Pack input: 10 AWG pads, bulk capacitance, TVS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "d87b9796-e127-5134-8cba-13196b8912f7"))
(text "Pack lead: 10 AWG pigtail soldered into J101/J102 with an XT90 male on its end; the pack carries the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "f8636c7d-25ec-5185-bf4a-c3a2902ec6c3"))
(text "XT90-S anti-spark female, the 125 A MIDI fuse at B+ and the JBD BMS in B-. P- after the BMS is board GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "fa00b3bc-8e89-56f6-9303-a3ce3e9c08a9"))
(text "No XT90PW board-mount: its drawing could not be read and Amass rates it 30 A (UL) / 60 A for 1 min." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "4bd1f5a1-e895-5620-9f9c-1dc31392246c"))
(text "Bulk at the pads (review P-M3): 3 x 680 uF 35 V low-ESR, 2 mF, so a main-switch trip or a BMS cut" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "9ed5329d-289b-5f2d-841d-80cadf9c20dc"))
(text "cannot ring the pack bus up. 1.5KE20A: 17.1 V standoff (above the 16.8 V CV setpoint), 27.7 V clamp." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "cbd747a3-944f-500a-8009-dd4e0ae3f067"))
(text "Top copper is BAT around the pads and FET drains; the bottom under it is GND (low-inductance loop)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "6855781e-5729-55e2-b588-9588662d2d12"))
